extends layout

block content
  .row
    .col-md-10
      h1#wb-cont(property="name")= title
    .col-md-2.text-right
      if user
        a.btn.btn-default(href='/edit/logout')
          span.glyphicon.glyphicon-log-out(aria-hidden="true")
          |  Logout
  
  a(href='/edit/questions') Edit Step 1 question mappings
  br
  a(href='/edit/clauses') Edit Step 2 clauses
  br
  a(href='/edit/infos') Edit Step 3 informative sections
  br
  h2 Document link markup
  p Underlining marks terms and references for linking in generated documents. Add an asterisk immediately after the underlined text as a marker; it is removed during generation. For a plural form where only the singular term should link, place the asterisk before the final s (for example, underline “menu” and enter “*s”). Links are created when a matching target is available.
  h2 Clause and question loader
  p the clause and question loaders should be used with great care. it will bulk overwrite records in the database. It is CRITICAL to back up the database before using this feature so that if the import fails you can revert to the previous state.
  a(href='/edit/clause_loader') Bulk update clause records
  br
  a(href='/edit/question_loader') Bulk update question records
  